abstract: >
  DRND II formulates a frozen spectral/topological transport sector of Discrete
  Relational Network Dynamics. The archive contains the manuscript PDF, LaTeX
  source files, machine-readable audit tables, and reproduction scripts for the
  reported galaxy/lensing ATP-vs-NFW diagnostic, the void morphology diagnostic,
  and the void-wall 19/2 topological-gain diagnostic.
